---
title: Sign — How to pay — Things 4 Good
permalink: /print/pay/
---
{% extends "print.njk" %}

{#- The QR codes and logos are the ones /pay/ uses (payment-methods.njk says where they come from). -#}

{% block style %}
  .body { justify-content: space-evenly; }
  .qrs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.18in; }
  .qr { border: 2px solid var(--c); border-radius: 16px; padding: 0.16in 0.14in 0.18in; text-align: center; background: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .qr .name { height: 0.42in; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 17pt; }
  .mk { fill: var(--c); height: 0.34in; width: auto; }
  .mk.word { height: 0.3in; }
  .qr img { width: 100%; max-width: 2.05in; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1; margin: 0.1in 0 0.08in; image-rendering: pixelated; }
  .qr .handle { font-weight: 800; font-size: 14pt; }
  .qr .how { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 10.5pt; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.3; }
  .note { margin: 0; padding: 0.14in 0.2in; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--marigold-t); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.16in; }
  .note .hand { font-size: 24pt; color: var(--marigold-d); line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; }
  .note p { font-size: 12.5pt; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; }
  .others { margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.18in; }
  .other { border-radius: 14px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0.16in 0.18in; }
  .other .name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14pt; height: 0.32in; }
  .other .mk { height: 0.3in; fill: #111; }
  .other .ico { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 0.3in; height: 0.3in; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pine); color: #fff; font-size: 12pt; }
  .other p { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.35; }
  .other b { white-space: nowrap; }
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="head">
  <p class="eyebrow">How to pay</p>
  <h1>Send your <em>donation.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead">Each candle is a <b>${{ site.pricePerCandle }} donation</b>. Scan a code with your phone&rsquo;s camera, or pay with cash or a check.</p>
</div>
